{
  "html": "<html><head><meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"></head><body style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; line-break: after-white-space;\">Two works for me. I’ll move the room booking and let the hotel know.<div><br></div><div>Ravi<br id=\"lineBreakAtBeginningOfMessage\"><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On 18 Aug 2026, at 10:12, Monika Weber &lt;monika@example.com&gt; wrote:</div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Thursday noon is tight for the Munich team. Could we start at two instead?</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Monika</div><div id=\"appendonsend\"></div><hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\" dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Sam Lee &lt;sam@example.com&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Monday, August 17, 2026 11:00 AM<br><b>To:</b> Offsite team &lt;offsite@example.com&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Offsite agenda</font><div>&nbsp;</div></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>Here is the first draft of the offsite agenda: we arrive Thursday at noon, the workshops are on Friday, and we head back on Saturday.</div><div><br></div><div>Does that work for everyone?</div><div><br></div><div>Sam</div></div></div></blockquote></div><br></div></body></html>",
